  <uml:Model xmi:id="model.refund-desk" name="Refund desk">
    <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="model.refund-desk.comment">
      <body>A support desk where an AI agent triages refund requests and proposes refunds, a timer escalates the ones nobody decided, a payment system reports the payout, and only a person approves. It shows actors that are not people (ADR-0210): laws about the kind of actor keep a human in the loop whatever the agent is given.</body>
    </ownedComment>
    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:DataType" xmi:id="type.Date" name="Date" />
